# The version to release, as a tag: v0.1.0, or v0.1.0-rc1 for a prerelease.
#
# Change this line in a pull request and merge it. When ci has passed on the commit
# that merged, cut-release.yml makes that tag on it and release.yml publishes the
# archives and the container images. A version that already has a tag is left
# alone, so this line can stay as it is after the release. Leave it empty (as it
# is now) to release nothing. See docs/RELEASING.md.
